WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.588
Here's what the coverage check
proves, against NIST's catalog.

2
00:00:03.588 --> 00:00:07.626
Every in-scope device onboarded
with an active sensor, excepted,

3
00:00:07.626 --> 00:00:11.512
or a ticket, supports the system
component inventory control.

4
00:00:11.512 --> 00:00:15.612
The sensor reporting, ring by
ring, supports system monitoring.

5
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:18.786
And a device that Defender
sees but the inventory

6
00:00:18.786 --> 00:00:22.113
doesn't list is an inventory
finding in its own right.

7
00:00:22.113 --> 00:00:26.301
The indicators are FedRAMP's, as
the implementation guide maps them.

8
00:00:26.301 --> 00:00:30.170
The records support these controls;
the assessor decides them.
